      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho mutu analavya sadaka ya amani kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu na sadakaye ni ngʼombe lume au chetu, nyama hiye asikale na chirema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andaika mkpwonowe dzulu ya chitswa cha nyama hiye na kumtsindza kpwenye phatu pha kumenyera hema ra mkpwutano. Chisha alavyadzi-sadaka, ana a Aruni andahala milatso na kumwagira-mwagira pande zosi ne za pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marunya gosi ganagofwinika mahumbo na garigo dzulu ya mahumbo ga nyama wa sadaka iyo ya amani gandalaviwa dza sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Viratu vira andalavya figo zosi mbiri na marunyage phamwenga na chala cha ini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana a Aruni andaviocha hivyo vyosi dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka phamwenga na sadaka za kuochwa zinazokala dzulu ya kuni ziakazo pho dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka. Iyo ni zawadi yenye kungu nono imuhamirayo Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho sadaka iyo ya amani anayomlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu ni kula kundi ra mangʼondzi na mbuzi, phahi ni atsambulwe lume au chetu risirokala na chirema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho mutu andalavya ngʼondzi rikale sadakaye, phahi naarirehe mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye ni aike mkpwonowe dzulu ya chitswa cha nyama hiye na amtsindze mbere ya hema ra mkpwutano. Ana a Aruni andamwagira-mwagira milatsoye chila uphande wa phatu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha, kula kpwenye sadaka iyo ya amani inayolaviwa kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, mutu ni arehe seemu za marunya zilungirazo, mchira wosi wenye marunya okatwa phephi kabisa na mongomongo phamwenga na marunya gosi ganagofwinika mahumbo na marunya gosi garigo dzulu ya mahumbo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "piya figo zosi mbiri na marunyage phamwenga na chala cha ini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimala kuhenda hivyo, mlavyadzi-sadaka andaviocha hivyo vyosi dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka. Ni chakurya chinacholavirwa Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa kuochwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Napho sadakaye ni mbuzi, phahi naairehe mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuno akabandika mkpwonowe dzulu ya chitswa cha nyama hiye na kumtsindza mbere ya hema ra mkpwutano. Ana a Aruni andahala milatso na kuimwagira-mwagira pande zosi ne za pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu, andamlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu marunya gosi ganagofwinika mahumbo na gara garigo dzulu ya mahumbo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na figo zosi mbiri na marunyage phamwenga na chala cha ini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlavyadzi-sadaka andaviocha dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka dza chakurya chinacholaviwa kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu chenye kungu nono imuhamirayo Mwenyezi Mlungu. Marunya gosi ni ga Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Msirye marunya wala milatso hata chidide. Hiri ni lagizo ra kare na kare kula chivyazi hadi chivyazi ta kare na kare phatu phophosi mndiphokala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
